* NMOS Transistors
   M1 2 0 0 0 NMOS
   M2 0 2 0 0 NMOS
   M3 0 0 2 2 NMOS
   
   * PMOS Transistors
   M4 4 2 2 2 PMOS
   M5 4 4 2 2 PMOS
   
   * Current Sources
   IREF 2 0 DC IREF
   I2 0 2 DC I2
   I4 2 4 DC I4
   I5 0 4 DC I5
   I3 2 0 DC I3
   
   * Resistor
   R1 2 0 R
   
   * Voltage Sources (for convenience)
   VDD 4 0 DC VDD
   VSS 0 2 DC VSS
   VGSI 2 0 DC VGSI
   VGSS 4 0 DC VSGS